---
title: "restrict / only_additive / only_dep / make_immutable (Sui Framework: package)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_policy: assert cap.policy <= new_policy
    q_check_policy --> q_abort: new_policy < current (too permissive)
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ETooPermissive
    q_check_policy --> q_update: new_policy >= current
    q_update --> [*]: cap.policy = new_policy

    note right of q_check_policy
        INV-001: policy can only become MORE restrictive (one-way ratchet)
        INV-002: COMPATIBLE(0) -> ADDITIVE(128) -> DEP_ONLY(192)
        INV-003: make_immutable destroys UpgradeCap entirely
        INV-004: restriction is irreversible
    end note
